{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read",
      "Glob",
      "Grep",
      "Edit",
      "Write",
      "Bash(git status:*)",
      "Bash(git diff:*)",
      "Bash(git log:*)",
      "Bash(git checkout -b:*)",
      "Bash(git switch:*)",
      "Bash(git add:*)",
      "Bash(git commit:*)",
      "Bash(git push origin HEAD:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue list:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue view:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue create:*)",
      "Bash(gh issue comment:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr list:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr view:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr diff:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr create:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr comment:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr checks:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr merge * --auto --squash:*)",
      "Bash(gh run list:*)",
      "Bash(gh run view:*)",
      "Bash(gh release create --draft:*)",
      "Bash(npm test:*)",
      "Bash(npm run:*)",
      "Bash(npm ci:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(git push origin main:*)",
      "Bash(git push --force:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr merge * --admin:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr merge --admin:*)",
      "Bash(gh api * -X PUT */branches/*:*)",
      "Bash(gh api * -X DELETE:*)",
      "Bash(gh label:*)",
      "Bash(gh release edit:*)",
      "Bash(gh workflow disable:*)",
      "Bash(gh secret:*)",
      "Bash(gh variable:*)",
      "Edit(./CLAUDE.md)",
      "Edit(./.claude/**)",
      "Edit(./.github/workflows/**)",
      "Edit(./.github/geschuetzte-pfade.txt)",
      "Edit(./scripts/menschen.txt)",
      "Read(./.env)",
      "Read(./**/*.pem)",
      "Read(./secrets/**)"
    ],
    "ask": [
      "Bash(gh api:*)",
      "Bash(npm install:*)",
      "Bash(pip install:*)"
    ]
  },
  "_hinweis": [
    "Diese Datei bremst den lokalen Agenten. Sie ist die erste Verteidigungs-",
    "linie, nicht die letzte: sie liegt im Repo und laesst sich umschreiben.",
    "Deshalb steht .claude/** selbst unter den geschuetzten Pfaden, und",
    "deshalb entscheidet ueber einen Merge nicht diese Datei, sondern die",
    "vier Required Checks in .github/workflows/pr-pruefung.yml. Eine Regel,",
    "die der Geregelte aendern kann, ist eine Bitte."
  ]
}
